WEBVTT

00:02:56.714 --> 00:03:01.594
but in that moment I seriously considered
putting my instrument away forever.

00:03:01.636 --> 00:03:03.429
Now I'm 21 years old

00:03:03.471 --> 00:03:07.308
and I couldn't be more grateful to have
experienced that moment of discouragement

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:09.185
because it opened my eyes to the fact

00:03:09.185 --> 00:03:12.063
that for 13 million children
in the United States

00:03:12.063 --> 00:03:14.398
who live outside of major US cities,

00:03:14.398 --> 00:03:18.569
pursuing a career in something
like classical music, ballet, art,

00:03:18.569 --> 00:03:22.156
research or many other
historically exclusive fields

00:03:22.156 --> 00:03:25.701
is incredibly more difficult,
if not practically impossible.

00:03:26.369 --> 00:03:28.913
In classical music, for example,

00:03:28.955 --> 00:03:33.334
people of color make up only
around 15 percent of America’s orchestras,